WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.072
Detection lifecycle management treats detections as living operational assets.

00:00:04.072 --> 00:00:08.045
Effective programs manage intake, prioritization, design, documentation, testing, deployment,

00:00:08.045 --> 00:00:11.134
tuning, review, metrics, retirement, and continuous improvement.

00:00:11.134 --> 00:00:15.990
Detections should have purpose, ownership, telemetry, analyst guidance, and feedback loops.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.962
The goal is not to create the most alerts.

00:00:19.962 --> 00:00:25.700
The goal is to maintain meaningful signals that support defensive decision-making over time.
